  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Capacities to Better Manage Movements at Borders Along the Central Mediterranean Route</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Informed by ongoing discussions at policy level, including relevant global and regional processes, the project will contribute to the Government of Tunisia capacity of migration governance and border management, including targeted support at points of entry and support to enhancing rescue at sea operations along the Tunisian coasts.</narrative>
  </description>
